  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The JBoss repository ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://repository.jboss.org/maven2"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://repository.jboss.org/maven2",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": " is no longer available according to ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://community.jboss.org/en/build/blog/2011/06/01/blocking-repositoryjbossorgmaven2"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://community.jboss.org/en/build/blog/2011/06/01/blocking-repositoryjbossorgmaven2",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": ". It prevents to build the fcrepo project in case necessary dependencies were not already available in local .m2 repository.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "I am attaching a patch of pom.xml that resolves the issue for the master branch.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Older releases (tags) can be affected too. Maybe there should be a notice to put the new repository to local .m2/settings.xml if you do not intend to update older tags.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
